+**ADHD Navigation**:
+- Max 10 results per query (prevents overwhelm)
+- 3-level depth limit (prevents rabbit holes)
+- Progressive disclosure (signature → params → implementation)
+- Complexity scoring (0.0-1.0 to estimate cognitive load)
